    },
    {
      "entryId": "1sa-16-13",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The anointing oil and the abiding Spirit. First principle: the anointing is real and retroactive to the tribe of Judah — the Spirit comes upon David and never recorded as departing till the sin with Bathsheba's prayer.",
      "density": 2.6393,
      "words": 37,
