    {
      "entryId": "1sa-17-45",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Sword and spear versus the Name. First principle: the shepherd-boy's theology defeats the giant's arsenal — the battle is fought in a name, not in hardware.",
