    },
    {
      "entryId": "1sa-2-35",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "A priest after God's own heart, a sure house, walking before the anointed forever. First principle: Eli's house falls so the faithful-priest promise stands — fulfilled in Zadok and ultimately in the Son.",
      "density": 1.9107,
      "words": 33,
