    {
      "entryId": "1sa-16-1",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "Mourning ends; the horn fills; Jesse of Bethlehem is named. First principle: God's provided king comes from Bethlehem before David is born there — the town is already messianic address.",
      "density": 1.8929,
      "words": 30,
