    {
      "entryId": "1sa-17-47",
      "file": "bookThreadDetails",
      "field": "principle",
      "text": "The assembly learns salvation without sword or spear. First principle: ownership of the battle decides the outcome — the LORD gives into hands, and the assembly knows.",
